		(property "Description" "2026-09-29: host/communication Pico. Talks to the 5 module slots J1-J5 (UART), the shared-parameter widget (J7 I2C, J8 GPIO) and to the timer Pico U1 over the on-board UART link M_TX/M_RX (ex-J9). Own 3.3V rail (+3V3_H) - never tie to U1's 3.3V."
