		(descr "Raspberry Pi Pico 2 H on 2x20 2.54mm header pins, THT pads only; SWD and castellation pads do not touch the board (floating mount): no pads 41-43, SWD positions are F.Fab marks only; flashing is USB (BOOTSEL) only. The module FLOATS about 2.5mm above the board (header plastic standoff; 3D model raised by that amount). Courtyard = the two header-pin strips only, so LOW parts (front-side SMD / lead stubs, roughly <=2mm) may sit under the module body; the body outline is on F.Fab (not courtyard) because courtyards_overlap is a 2D check. OSC2026 timer board variant of RPi_Pico_SMD_TH")
